{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"35":"Combing the Hair (Kitab Al-Tarajjul)"},"section_detail":{"35":{"hadithnumber_first":4159,"hadithnumber_last":4213,"arabicnumber_first":4159,"arabicnumber_last":4213,"name_native":"كتاب الترجّل"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":4159,"arabicnumber":4159,"text":"حدثنا مسدد، حدثنا يحيى، عن هشام بن حسان، عن الحسن، عن عبد الله بن مغفل، قال نهى رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم عن الترجل الا غبا","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":35,"hadith":1}}]}